    "text": "eccathletics.com\nwebsite\nIowa Falls, Iowa\nJamir Brown Recognized as ICCAC Athlete of the Week\n1 days ago\nEllsworth Community College linebacker Jamir Brown has been named the ICCAC Defensive Athlete of the Week, following a standout performance that lifted the Panthers to a thrilling 41-38 win over Highland Community College. A freshman who’s made an immediate impact this fall, Brown recorded six tackles, including two tackles for...",
